      "created_at": "2022-07-01T21:22:30.285Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea\" title=\"20220701171517_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20220701171517_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"angBsyNvykZ9uZdcuBdwamHPNOO\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/48b711ffe36935b2063418851f175698cd62a0ea_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220701171517_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 425 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Just got to this week’s challenge. Not really that tough. This team works very well together, and the environment helped more than it hindered. Extra card plays and ninjas taking out thugs and underbosses, and they ended up going under Resurrection Ritual. Had enough environment destruction to make sure the Dragon never showed up, so it was no problem. Nightmist got two rounds in a row of Mistbound on the Chairman, with some help from Parse moving a copy up from the bottom.</p>",
